---
import { Building2, Truck, ArrowRight } from '@lucide/astro';
import BgVideo from '@/components/media/BgVideo.astro';
---
<section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 py-14 lg:px-10 lg:py-20" aria-labelledby="cta-t">
  <div class="relative isolate overflow-hidden rounded-card bg-chrome px-6 py-10 text-white sm:px-10 sm:py-14">
    <BgVideo desktop="cierre-cabina" poster="cierre-cabina" width={1280} height={720} control label="vídeo de la cabina" class="bgv--flat" controlClass="right-3 top-3" />
    <div class="relative">
      <h2 id="cta-t" class="max-w-xl text-balance text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-[32px] sm:leading-[1.15]">Empieza hoy, según cómo trabajes</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-white/85">Crea tu cuenta, valida tu RUC y arma tu primera solicitud o tu flota en minutos.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
        <a href="/registro" class="group rounded-card border border-white/20 bg-chrome/50 backdrop-blur-sm p-5 transition-colors hover:border-white/30 hover:bg-chrome/70">
          <Building2 size={22} class="text-emerald-500" aria-hidden="true" />
          <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold">Tengo carga que enviar</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/85">Crea la cuenta de tu empresa y publica tu primera solicitud.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium">Crear cuenta de empresa <ArrowRight size={16} class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" aria-hidden="true" /></span>
        </a>
        <a href="/registro?tipo=transportista" class="group rounded-card border border-white/20 bg-chrome/50 backdrop-blur-sm p-5 transition-colors hover:border-white/30 hover:bg-chrome/70">
          <Truck size={22} class="text-emerald-500" aria-hidden="true" />
          <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold">Soy transportista</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/85">Registra tu flota y oferta por las cargas compatibles.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium">Registrarme para ofertar <ArrowRight size={16} class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" aria-hidden="true" /></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
